  "definition": "Standards Applicable to Outside Service Providers",
  "effectiveDate": "2019-01-09",
  "historyNote": "#7478, eff 4-10-01; ss by #9415, INTERIM, eff 4-5-09, EXPIRED: 10-2-09 New. #9595, eff 11-11-09, EXPIRED 11-11-17 New. #12512, INTERIM, eff 4-11-18, EXPIRED: 10-8-18 New. #12708, eff 1-9-19",
